//! stdlib/testmod/named_item_holder.sio
//! Witness fixture for PR #2515 review round 7, finding B (comment_id
//! 4091287602): a function literally named `tc_c`, unrelated to the real
//! `testmod::tc_c` module (stdlib/testmod/tc_c.sio). Imported by-name
//! elsewhere as `testmod::named_item_holder::tc_c`, which resolves as a
